Description: VAAPI driver for V4L2 stateless video decoders
 Userspace VAAPI driver driving Linux V4L2 stateless decoders through the
 media request API (Allwinner cedrus, Rockchip rkvdec/hantro, NXP hantro,
 Amlogic meson-vdec).
 .
 This Lierfang build carries the fixes needed for the H618/cedrus setup:
 modern H.264 stateless uAPI adaptation for kernel 6.x, correct
 nal_ref_idc for B-frame direct prediction, a decode width rounded to 64
 bytes so the Mali/Panfrost DMA-BUF import accepts the linear NV12
 surface, and capture pool accounting based on the buffer count actually
 granted by VIDIOC_CREATE_BUFS.
